Save as %USERPROFILE%\.codex\hooks.json (merge with what's there), then review and trust it with /hooks:
{
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit":  [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 5 }] }],
    "PostToolUse":       [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 5 }] }],
    "PermissionRequest": [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 5 }] }],
    "Stop":              [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 5 }] }],
    "Interrupt":         [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 2 }] }],
    "SessionEnd":        [{ "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "mochi-cli hook codex", "timeout": 2 }] }]
  }
}
Older Codex without hooks: put notify = ["mochi-cli", "hook", "codex"] at the top of
%USERPROFILE%\.codex\config.toml (only "done" is shown then).
